 range of $x,$ note that $x=5-4t\\le 9$ for all $t\\ge -1.$ Consequently, the range of $x$ is\n\n$$\nx\\le 9.\n$$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ note that $y=t+1\\ge 0$ for all $t\\ge -1.$ Consequently, the range of $y$ is\n\n$$\ny\\ge 0.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302276 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5261222-5c84-53d7-83dc-4815f45597be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300863}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b5261222-5c84-53d7-83dc-4815f45597be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300863} :answer-field/id #uuid "017f20f8-f3be-5028-8a3f-9c0169ff1daf" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301237} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1eec746e-403a-5509-a259-b2a25c7f614e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300105}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1eec746e-403a-5509-a259-b2a25c7f614e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300105} :answer-field/id #uuid "08bf2134-aeb2-5dc1-89fe-6267bdf0284c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301250} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "49dda00b-4cd7-585e-b882-2ec765cb77ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300338}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "49dda00b-4cd7-585e-b882-2ec765cb77ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300338} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8cf1062-9505-5905-a983-1cd976df11d8" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301831} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6c2c622-589c-57e8-8e2b-f4a0e13ed191" :answer/type {:db/ident :a