an conclude that $-\\frac{5}{2}\\le x\\le \\frac{5}{2}.$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ notice that for $0\\le \\theta <2\\pi ,$ we have \n$-1\\le \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\le 1.$ Consequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\le 1 \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & \\le \\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\le \\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4}+2 & \\le \\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +2\\le \\frac{3}{4}+2 \\\\ \\frac{5}{4} & \\le y\\le \\frac{11}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $\\frac{5}{4}\\le y\\le \\frac{11}{4}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302369 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5fc55285-7159-598c-b031-86c3a09369ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300452}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5fc55285-7159-598c-b031-86c3a09369ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300452} :answer-field/id #uuid "5454d034-fb34-5c9d-9fdc-5040c6123974" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301500} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6f2b08d-def0-5143-ae5b-f41692d30357" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c6f2b08d-def0-5143-ae5b-f41692d30357" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300959} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a9096a0-c2c7-59b6-b3c3-5386eaf386e7" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301664} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c95b9b0-7ba0-5073-9f2d-563965383d18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300583}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7c95b9b0-7ba0-5073-9f2d-563965383d18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer